-- Replaces the shared "The Phenom Regime (8-Week)" program content with
-- David's personal weight-loss routine: daily 2-mile run + jump rope
-- intervals, then a 5-day training split (Chest/Tri, Back/Bi, Legs, Core,
-- Cardio), with progressive overload guidance every 2 weeks and plank
-- duration increasing each phase. Only affects the SHARED program content
-- (user_id is null) — any client with a custom/individualized plan on this
-- program is untouched.

